@startuml
' Native (no helper nodes) knobs that still have an effect under linetype ortho
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 70
title 06 - native label/note knobs under ortho

[A1] as a1
[B1] as b1
[A2] as a2
[B2] as b2
[A3] as a3
[B3] as b3
[A4] as a4
[B4] as b4
[A5] as a5
[B5] as b5

' 1) plain label (xlabel, placed by graphviz)
a1 --> b1 : plain label

' 2) padding with non-breaking spaces pushes the text sideways
a2 --> b2 : <U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0>padded right

' 3) leading/trailing empty lines push the text up/down
a3 --> b3 : \n\n\nshifted down

' 4) head / tail labels (multiplicity slots) next to the arrow ends
a4 "tail" --> "head" b4

' 5) note positions on links
a5 --> b5
note right on link : note right on link

a1 --> a2
note left on link : note left on link
a3 --> a4
note top on link : note top on link
b3 --> b4
note bottom on link : note bottom on link
@enduml
